  "job_B8.1.4.5_20251003_114817": {
    "chunk_text": "re stefne: Beo se man awyrged \u00f0e Beo se man awyrged \u00f0e ne arwur\u00f0a\u00f0 his f\u00e6der & his modor; & eall folc cwy\u00f0, Amen. Sy se man awyrged \u00f0e forhwyrfe his freondes landgem\u00e6ru; & eall folc cwy\u00f0, Amen. Beo se man awryged \u00f0e deme unrihte domas steopcildum & wydewum; & cwy\u00f0e eal folc, Amen. Sy se awyrged se \u00f0e h\u00e6me mid his f\u00e6der wife; & eal folc cwe\u00f0e, Amen. Beo se man awyrged \u00f0e h\u00e6me wi\u00f0 nyten; & cwe\u00f0e eall \u00f0\u00e6t folc, Amen. Sy \u00f0e man awyrged se \u00f0e h\u00e6me wi\u00f0 his swustor, o\u00f0\u00f0e wi\u00f0 his swegre; & eal folc cwy\u00f0, Amen. Sy \u00e6lc mor\u00f0slaga awyrged; & eal folc cwy\u00f0, Amen. Sy se awyrged \u00f0e unscyldigne mann bel\u00e6we wi\u00f0 metsceatte; & eal folc cwy\u00f0, Amen. Beo se awyrged \u00f0e wuna\u00f0 on \u00f0isse \u00e6, & hi mid sp\u00e6con & mid wordum gefyl\u00f0 & nele mid GYF \u00f0u \u00f0onne Drihtne hyrsumast & his beboda healtst, \u00f0e ic \u00f0e bebeode, Drihten \u00f0in God \u00f0e gede\u00f0 Ealle \u00f0as bletsunga cuma\u00f0 ofer \u00f0e, gyf \u00f0u gehealtst his beboda. Beo \u00f0u gebletsod on byrig; beo \u00f0u gebletsod on lande. Beo \u00f0ines inno\u00f0es w\u00e6stm gebletsod, & \u00feines landes w\u00e6stm, & \u00f0inre nytena w\u00e6stm. Beon \u00f0ine bernu gebletsode, & eac \u00f0ine lafa. Beo \u00f0u gebletsod ing",
